OL,3,AMeta fined $25bn for 'lies' over user
OL,4,Adata privacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeta, the company behind Facebook,
OL,7,FInstagram and WhatsApp has been hit
OL,8,Fwith the largest ever fine against it
OL,9,Ffor its business practices.
OL,11,FA judge in New Mexico on Wednesday
OL,12,Fordered the company to pay $25bn
OL,13,F(#18.6bn) following a two-week trial
OL,14,Fearlier this year that found it had
OL,15,Fspent years lying to the public about
OL,16,Fhow it handled Facebook user data.
OL,18,F"The lies extend beyond Facebook's data
OL,19,Fpractices as well," the judge said,
OL,20,Fadding they went to "the heart of
OL,21,FFacebook's core business practices".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
