OL,3,AMeta fined $25bn for 'lies' over user
OL,4,Adata privacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeta's head lawyer CJ Mahoney said the
OL,7,Fruling made it "all but impossible to
OL,8,Fdo business in the state of New
OL,9,FMexico". The company intends to appeal,
OL,10,Fa move Mahoney said will be successful.
